    "notes": [
      {
        "category": "summary",
        "text": "An update is available for libssh.\nThis update affects Rocky Linux 9.\nA Common Vulnerability Scoring System (CVSS) base score, which gives a detailed severity rating, is available for each vulnerability from the CVE list",
        "title": "Topic"
      },
      {
        "category": "description",
        "text": "libssh is a library which implements the SSH protocol. It can be used to implement client and server applications.\n\nSecurity Fix(es):\n\n* libssh: Invalid return code for chacha20 poly1305 with OpenSSL backend (CVE-2025-5987)\n\nFor more details about the security issue(s), including the impact, a CVSS score, acknowledgments, and other related information, refer to the CVE page(s) listed in the References section.\n\nThis advisory is provided by Ctrl IQ, Inc for Rocky Linux systems. For more information about CIQ security practices, visit https://ciq.com/security.",
        "title": "Description"
      },
